{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>半島酒店推士多啤梨抹茶拿鐵！</h2>\n<p>聖誕將至，香港半島酒店將曾掀起社交平台熱潮的人氣抹茶拿鐵升級，推出節日限定版「士多啤梨抹茶拿鐵」。士多啤梨果肉再疊上綿密順滑的抹茶奶泡，紅白綠三色分明，入口先嚐到清新果甜，隨後抹茶的微甘回甘緩緩浮現，甜而不膩，層次分明，令人一試難忘。除了士多啤梨抹茶拿鐵，店內亦同步推出「提拉米蘇拿鐵」，杯邊更附上一條Ladyfinger，邊喝邊蘸著厚厚的奶泡與咖啡，口感豐富，大滿足。\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542313240175262_13191190936b03fb9cd9c57.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542313240175262_13191190936b03fb9cd9c57.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542313455287818_8450487226b03fb9f0bdbd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542313455287818_8450487226b03fb9f0bdbd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DgE5tqgEyQe/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:54:08.499208+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":283,"images":2,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:38:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T08:47:36.732352+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T08:47:36.732352+00:00","content_hash":"98640345e4dacba07794738fee04fd576f4e639e4cb37e2cb602d32fa6bf88de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}